<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for the Digimon Master Online 
simple macro can be use on every map


Screen Resolution : Full Screen 1920x1080

Shortcut in game setting:
Skill shortcut is F1 and F2
HP shortcut is F6
DS shortcut is 8
Pick up shortcut is 2 

line 1 for find digimon
line 7 for check digimon health
line 25 to heal HP
line 29 to heal DS
line 35 for check if target digimon die or not
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>GoColor 10 1 177,48,35 255,255,255 2 969 52 5 7 1 0
KeyDown 43 1
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 64
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyDown 59 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 59 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyDown 58 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 58 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 18 6
GoColor 25 1 0,0,51 255,255,255 2 197 124 3 7 1 0
Goto 29
KeyDown 63 1
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 63 1
Delay 111 ms
GoColor 36 0 0,0,51 255,255,255 2 131 138 3 7 1 0
KeyDown 37 1
Goto 36
Delay 111 ms
KeyUp 37 1
Delay 111 ms
GoColor 14 0 0,0,51 255,255,255 2 829 52 1 8 1 0
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Digimon Masters Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>